 t.push_str("\nThe baseline112andcandidate117unfiltered native core tests pass, plus raw2/cubic6andgeneratedIFMA checks for each source. Unchanged field source inherits the pinned33-test `znver4` qualification. Every timed result equals its stream reference,point order agrees with the compressed key,and requested peak stays within the typed bound plus scalar clone. One output hint per shape agrees across all local and remote processes.\n\nExact-container local preflight runs8processes/32rawqueries before publication. Remote runs230processes/4882rawqueries including all reference setups, for4914combined calls. No SDK/Gnark proofs; prior5958unchanged. All helper binaries are built before capture. No successful capture is excluded or repeated.\n\n## Profiles and machine state\n\nSix primary profiles follow all latency processes: fresh stream,generic,prefix at32and96workers,64timed calls after2primes and1reference,cycles:u at199Hz. Recording is gated after preparation. Direct pinned perf uses `--no-buildid-cache`. Aggregate samples are descriptive,not exclusive-stage CPU or causal wall-time evidence.\n\n|Profile|Samples|Lost records|Sampled process count|\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n");
 for(name,p)in a["profiles"].as_object().unwrap(){writeln!(t,"|{name}|{}|{}|{}|",p["samples"],p["lost_records"],p["sampled_pids"].as_array().unwrap().len()).unwrap();let raw=remote.join(format!("profiles/{name}/perf.data"));assert_eq!(hash(raw),p["raw_sha256"].as_str().unwrap());}
 t.push_str("\nTopology,CPU flags,and cgroup CPU/memory/swap snapshots are retained before the workflow,after latency,and after profiles. These counters cover entire stages and are not attributed to individual queries. Profiles and their raw hashes are retained locally; decoded reports are archived.\n\n## Scope and next decision\n\nA component pass would motivate a separately designed hardware-selected strategy followed by all-nine verified SDK,memory and consumer qualification. It does not authorize promoting either locally slower tree or claiming a full-proof gain. This study does not measure Aeglos,concurrent throughput,phones,TEE,memory pressure,swap or giant circuits. [Latest C7a whole-proof comparison](../2026-10-26-lower-bound-c7a/README.md) and [latest local all-nine SDK table](../2026-10-26-prefix-pool/README.md) retain supplied M5 CPU/Metal references. The all-eightCPU10× objective remains active and unmet.\n\nThe owned instance is terminated; its EBS volume,temporary ECR tag,private S3 object and bucket are absent,and the presigned URL parameter file is deleted. No production networking or IAM changes. [Frozen design](artifacts/design.md),[analysis](artifacts/remote-results/output/measure/analysis.json),[cleanup](artifacts/cleanup-complete.json),and[artifact index](artifacts/artifact-index.json) retain the evidence.\n");
 fs::create_dir_all(D).unwrap();fs::write(Path::new(D).join("README.md"),t).unwrap();let dest=Path::new(D).join("artifacts");fs::create_dir_all(&dest).unwrap();let mut files=Vec::new();for folder in ["baseline-source","candidate-source","support","native","local-output","remote-results"]{walk(&r.join(folder),&mut files);}for e in fs::read_dir(r).unwrap(){let e=e.unwrap();if e.file_type().unwrap().is_file(){files.push(e.path());}}
 let mut index=BTreeMap::new();for p in files{let rel=p.strip_prefix(r).unwrap();let s=rel.display().to_string();if s.contains(".secret")||s=="upload-parameters.secret.json"{continue;}let ext=p.extension().and_then(|x|x.to_str()).unwrap_or("");if !matches!(ext,"rs"|"json"|"md"|"log"|"txt"|"toml"|"lock"|"sh"){continue;}let target=dest.join(rel);fs::create_dir_all(target.parent().unwrap()).unwrap();fs::copy(&p,&target).unwrap();index.insert(s,hash(target));}
 for(p,h)in &index{assert_eq!(hash(dest.join(p)),*h);}save(dest.join("artifact-index.json"),&json!({"sha256":index,"raw_profiles_local_only":a["profiles"]}));let result=json!({"root":R,"report":format!("{D}/README.md"),"raw_query_calls":4914,"SDK_proofs":0,"Gnark_exports":0,"prior_proof_count":5958,"calibration_passed":a["calibration_passed"],"generic_gate_passed":a["generic_gate_passed"],"prefix_gate_passed":a["prefix_gate_passed"],"archive_hashes":index.len(),"cleanup_verified":true,"adopted":false,"goal_achieved":false});save(r.join("closeout.json"),&result);state("G2 tree C7a closed; ready to commit/push",result);println!("Archived {} files;4914rawqueries;no adoption",index.len());
